Package: cinminai-admin
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Cin-MinAI <https://github.com/Cin-MinAI/Cin-MinAI>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-gi, dbus, polkitd, systemd, apt, kmod, util-linux, e2fsprogs, dosfstools
Description: Privileged action mechanism for Cin-MinAI
 A root-owned, D-Bus-activated mechanism with a small typed vocabulary.
 Every request is validated before a fresh polkit administrator check and is
 written to a local hash-chained audit log. It provides no privileged shell.
